    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Inspired by the glittering galaxy, this Divas' Dream evening bag is entirely covered in deep midnight-blue crystals, with colorful crystals outlining planets of all sizes. The vibrant hues create a joyful atmosphere and spark boundless imagination about the cosmos. The interior is lined in lapis lazuli-colored nappa lambskin, and the clasp is set with a fan-shaped lapis lazuli, highlighting the brand's iconic symbol.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
